  "_comment": "Dependency graph for the impact analyzer (tools/impact.py). 'symbols' are calculations/identities/tabs/globals identified by literal code 'patterns'. A symbol may 'feed' other symbols and/or 'affect' visualizations. Edit this when you add a calc or viz. impact.py also warns if a symbol's patterns no longer exist (map drift).",

  "visualizations": {
